{"name":"Awe","hex":"#f0d6cf","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Awe","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname.","A short river between Loch Awe and Loch Etive, Argyll and Bute council area, Scotland; in full, the River Awe."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Awe"}],"entries":[{"title":"Awe","blocks":[{"text":"Awe is an emotion comparable to wonder but less joyous. On Robert Plutchik's wheel of emotions awe is modeled as a combination of surprise and fear. Keltner and Haidt, in a highly-cited paper, describe it as 'In the upper reaches of pleasure and on the boundary of fear'."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/John_Martin_-_Destruction_of_Tyre_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/330px-John_Martin_-_Destruction_of_Tyre_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awe"},{"title":"Awe (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Awe is a 2018 Indian Telugu-language psychological cross genre film written and directed by Prasanth Varma. It is produced by Nani and Prashanti Tipirneni under their maiden production house Wall Poster Cinema. The film features an ensemble cast of Kajal Aggarwal, Nithya Menen, Regina Cassandra, Eesha Rebba, Srinivas Avasarala, Priyadarshi Pullikonda and Murali Sharma. It also features the voices of Nani and Ravi Teja. Awe deals with issues like child abuse, sexual abuse, lesbianism, and drug abuse."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/81/Awe_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Awe_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Wanderer_above_the_Sea_of_Fog.jpeg/500px-Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Wanderer_above_the_Sea_of_Fog.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Wanderer_above_the_Sea_of_Fog.jpeg/1280px-Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Wanderer_above_the_Sea_of_Fog.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Wanderer_above_the_Sea_of_Fog.jpeg/500px-Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Wanderer_above_the_Sea_of_Fog.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wanderer above the Sea of Fog (1818) by German Romantic landscape painter Caspar David Friedrich","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACaspar_David_Friedrich_-_Wanderer_above_the_Sea_of_Fog.jpeg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/John_Martin_-_The_Great_Day_of_His_Wrath_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/500px-John_Martin_-_The_Great_Day_of_His_Wrath_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/John_Martin_-_The_Great_Day_of_His_Wrath_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-John_Martin_-_The_Great_Day_of_His_Wrath_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/John_Martin_-_The_Great_Day_of_His_Wrath_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/500px-John_Martin_-_The_Great_Day_of_His_Wrath_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Great Day of His Wrath by John Martin","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJohn_Martin_-_The_Great_Day_of_His_Wrath_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Atlanta_Lightning_Strike_edit1.jpg/500px-Atlanta_Lightning_Strike_edit1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Atlanta_Lightning_Strike_edit1.jpg/1280px-Atlanta_Lightning_Strike_edit1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Atlanta_Lightning_Strike_edit1.jpg/500px-Atlanta_Lightning_Strike_edit1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"This Atlanta lightning strike may have inspired awe.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAtlanta_Lightning_Strike_edit1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Frau_vor_untergehender_Sonne.jpg/500px-Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Frau_vor_untergehender_Sonne.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Frau_vor_untergehender_Sonne.jpg/1280px-Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Frau_vor_untergehender_Sonne.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Frau_vor_untergehender_Sonne.jpg/500px-Caspar_David_Friedrich_-_Frau_vor_untergehender_Sonne.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Painting by German Romantic landscape painter Caspar David Friedrich conveying a sense of awe and wonder at a natural sunset","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACaspar_David_Friedrich_-_Frau_vor_untergehender_Sonne.jpg"}],"sounds":{"Awe":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/En-Awe.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/75/En-Awe.ogg/En-Awe.ogg.mp3"}]}}}